# Rust
/target
**/target
*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this core builds into a shipped application and we want
# reproducible, audited dependency builds (req 7.7).

# Flutter / Dart: app/ has its own .gitignore (generated by `flutter create`), which is
# the authoritative one for that subtree.

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Local secrets / data — must never be committed
*.db
*.sqlcipher
*.key
*.env
secrets/
